{"guide":{"questionsToConsider":["What are your course levels, and what does a student need to know before each one?","Which answers would you use to place a student who isn't sure?","Do you accept employer funding, and what do employers need on an invoice?","Do you offer bursaries or reduced fees, and who decides?"],"howToUseResponses":"Have a tutor read the placement answers for everyone who picked 'Not sure' and reply with a recommended course within a few days, before they lose interest. Check the goal answers against the course they chose, since someone who wants to ship a project may be in the wrong level. Send employer invoices from the details given, and pass bursary answers only to the panel.","customizeSteps":["Replace the course list with your own, and rewrite the placement questions around what separates your levels.","Edit the funding options and endings to match how students actually pay you, including your payment instructions.","Share the link on your course pages or embed it there, and export enrollments to CSV for your class lists."],"faqs":[{"q":"What should a course enrollment form include?","a":"Student contact details, the course, their experience, goals, when they can study, any support needs and how they're paying. A placement path helps students who aren't sure which level fits."},{"q":"How do I place students at the right level?","a":"Ask about their experience and what they've done before, then have a tutor read the answers. This form only asks those questions of students who say they're not sure."},{"q":"Can the form handle employer-funded students?","a":"Yes. Choosing employer funding asks for the company, the invoice email and a purchase order number, and ends on a message about invoicing."},{"q":"Is a student enrolled as soon as they submit?","a":"That's up to you. Most schools confirm the place by email once they've checked the course has room and payment is arranged."}]},"doc":{"schemaVersion":10,"title":"Course enrollment","description":"Enroll students, place them at the right level, and sort out who's paying.","blocks":[{"id":"blk_courseen00","ref":"welcome","title":"Welcome! Let's get you enrolled.","required":false,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"buttonLabel":"Start","type":"welcome"},{"id":"blk_courseen01","ref":"contact","title":"First, your details","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"contact_info","fields":["first_name","last_name","email","phone"]},{"id":"blk_courseen02","ref":"course","title":"Which course would you like to join?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"dropdown","options":[{"id":"opt_foundations","label":"Foundations","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_intermediate","label":"Intermediate","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_advanced","label":"Advanced","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_not_sure_help","label":"Not sure, help me choose","image_key":null}]},{"id":"blk_courseen03","ref":"why_this_level","title":"What makes that the right level for you?","required":false,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"short_text","unique":false,"minLength":0,"maxLength":300},{"id":"blk_courseen04","ref":"experience","title":"How much experience do you already have?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"opinion_scale","steps":5,"startAt":1,"labelLow":"None at all","labelHigh":"A lot"},{"id":"blk_courseen05","ref":"prior_study","title":"Have you done any of these before?","required":false,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"multi_select","options":[{"id":"opt_a_short_course","label":"A short course or bootcamp","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_taught_myself_from","label":"Taught myself from books or videos","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_used_it_at","label":"Used it at work","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_studied_it_formally","label":"Studied it formally","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_none_of_these","label":"None of these","image_key":null}],"minSelections":0,"maxSelections":5,"allowOther":false},{"id":"blk_courseen06","ref":"self_assessment","title":"Describe something you've made or solved with it","description":"A sentence is plenty. It's the fastest way for a tutor to place you.","required":false,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"long_text","minLength":0,"maxLength":600,"aiQualityCheck":false},{"id":"blk_courseen07","ref":"goal","title":"What do you want to be able to do by the end?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"long_text","minLength":0,"maxLength":800,"aiQualityCheck":false},{"id":"blk_courseen08","ref":"schedule","title":"When can you study?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"multi_select","options":[{"id":"opt_weekday_mornings","label":"Weekday mornings","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_weekday_evenings","label":"Weekday evenings","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_weekends","label":"Weekends","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_any_time","label":"Any time","image_key":null}],"minSelections":1,"maxSelections":4,"allowOther":false},{"id":"blk_courseen09","ref":"format","title":"How would you rather learn?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"single_select","options":[{"id":"opt_in_person","label":"In person","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_live_online","label":"Live online","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_at_my_own","label":"At my own pace","image_key":null}],"allowOther":false},{"id":"blk_courseen10","ref":"accessibility","title":"Anything we should know to support you?","description":"Access needs, dyslexia, caring responsibilities, anything at all.","required":false,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"long_text","minLength":0,"maxLength":600,"aiQualityCheck":false},{"id":"blk_co